### Каждый endpoint один раз
### Run по порядку

@baseUrl = https://hack-umms-team-3-backend-virtual-machine-2311dc.vm.prodcontest.com
@password = password123
@slugBackend = bkd-mtup-jun
@acceptRequestId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaa0001
@rejectRequestId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaa0002
@user5Id = bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbb005
@user8Id = bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbb008

### 1. Health — сервер жив
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Register — регистрация
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jury-user",
  "contacts": [
    {
      "type": "TELEGRAM",
      "value": "@jury_user"
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Login user1 — вход
### @name loginUser1
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@example.com",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenUser1", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 4. Профиль — кто я
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 5. Обновить профиль
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Иван Петров"
}

### 6. Мои контакты
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 7. Сохранить контакты
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contacts": [
    { "type": "TELEGRAM", "value": "@ivan_petrov" },
    { "type": "PHONE", "value": "+79001234501" }
  ]
}

### 8. Аватар — загрузка
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="fixture.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./fixture.png
--WebAppBoundary--

### 9. Список событий
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 10. Событие по slug
### @name backendEvent
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/slug/{{slugBackend}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

> {%
    client.global.set("backendEventId", response.body.id);
%}

### 11. Событие по id
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/{{backendEventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 12. Мои события
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/events
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 13. Участники + теги
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/{{backendEventId}}/participants?tags=backend
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 14. Мои теги на событии
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/{{backendEventId}}/participants/me/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 15. Задать теги
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/{{backendEventId}}/participants/me/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tags": ["backend", "nodejs"]
}

### 16. Статистика события
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/{{backendEventId}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 17. Редактировать событие
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/{{backendEventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Backend & DevOps Meetup"
}

### 18. Создать событие
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Jury Check Event",
  "date": "2026-08-01T12:00:00.000Z",
  "description": "Событие для проверки API",
  "tags": ["jury", "check"]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("juryEventId", response.body.id);
%}

### 19. Обложка события
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/{{juryEventId}}/image
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="fixture.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./fixture.png
--WebAppBoundary--

