%}

### 28. Отклонить запрос
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/{{backendEventId}}/match-requests/{{rejectRequestId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser8}}

### 29. Мгновенный match
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/{{backendEventId}}/match-requests/instant
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser7}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toUserId": "{{user8Id}}"
}

